---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Omegle Alternative — Best Free Voice Chat Replacement | Airwalk" description="Looking for an Omegle alternative? Airwalk is a free voice-only random chat — no video, no bots, no signup. The best Omegle replacement in 2025.">
	<header class="bg-canvas/80 backdrop-blur-xl border-b border-hairline h-14 flex items-center justify-between px-4 md:px-8 sticky top-0 z-40">
		<a href="/" class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-ink"><svg class="w-7 h-7 text-primary" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2z"/></svg><span class="font-extrabold text-lg uppercase">Airwalk</span></a>
		<a href="/chat" class="bg-primary hover:bg-primary-deep text-on-primary font-semibold text-sm py-2 px-5 rounded-lg transition-colors">Try Airwalk Free</a>
	</header>
	<main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-12 space-y-8">
		<h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-ink">The Best Omegle Alternative in 2025</h1>
		<p class="text-lg text-slate leading-relaxed">Omegle shut down, but the desire to talk to strangers online didn't. Airwalk is the modern Omegle alternative — voice-only, spam-free, and completely free. No video pressure, no bots, no premium paywalls.</p>

		<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink">Airwalk vs Omegle</h2>
		<div class="overflow-x-auto">
			<table class="w-full text-sm border border-hairline rounded-xl overflow-hidden">
				<thead class="bg-surface"><tr class="border-b border-hairline"><th class="text-left p-3 font-bold text-ink">Feature</th><th class="p-3 font-bold text-primary">Airwalk</th><th class="p-3 font-bold text-slate">Omegle (was)</th></tr></thead>
				<tbody class="divide-y divide-hairline">
					<tr><td class="p-3">Video required</td><td class="p-3 text-accent font-bold">No ✓</td><td class="p-3 text-steel">Yes</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="p-3">Bots & spam</td><td class="p-3 text-accent font-bold">Blocked ✓</td><td class="p-3 text-steel">Rampant</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="p-3">Gender filter</td><td class="p-3 text-accent font-bold">Free ✓</td><td class="p-3 text-steel">Paid</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="p-3">Country filter</td><td class="p-3 text-accent font-bold">Free ✓</td><td class="p-3 text-steel">None</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="p-3">In-call games</td><td class="p-3 text-accent font-bold">5 games ✓</td><td class="p-3 text-steel">None</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="p-3">Friends system</td><td class="p-3 text-accent font-bold">Yes ✓</td><td class="p-3 text-steel">No</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="p-3">Still active</td><td class="p-3 text-accent font-bold">Yes ✓</td><td class="p-3 text-steel">Shut down</td></tr>
				</tbody>
			</table>
		</div>

		<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink">Why People Switch to Airwalk from Omegle-like Sites</h2>
		<ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-slate space-y-2">
			<li><strong>No unwanted video</strong> — Voice-only means no exposure, no screenshots, no explicit content</li>
			<li><strong>Anti-spam system</strong> — 20-second skip cooldown eliminates bots completely</li>
			<li><strong>Real conversations</strong> — Interest matching connects you with compatible people</li>
			<li><strong>Free forever</strong> — No hidden charges, no coins, no "premium" locks</li>
			<li><strong>Modern UI</strong> — Clean, fast, works on any device</li>
			<li><strong>Games</strong> — Play Wordle, Connect Four, Tic-Tac-Toe while chatting</li>
		</ul>

		<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink">Other Omegle Alternatives Compared</h2>
		<p class="text-slate">Sites like AirTalk, Whisperly, and Ome.gg all charge for basic features (gender filter costs money on AirTalk). Airwalk gives you everything for free — making it the only truly free Omegle alternative.</p>

		<div class="bg-primary rounded-xl p-8 text-center space-y-3">
			<h3 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-on-primary">Try the Best Omegle Alternative</h3>
			<p class="text-on-primary/80">Free voice chat, no camera, no signup. Just real conversations.</p>
			<a href="/chat" class="inline-block bg-white text-primary font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors">Start Chatting — Free</a>
		</div>
	</main>
	<footer class="border-t border-hairline py-8 px-4 text-center text-xs text-steel"><p>© 2025 Airwalk. <a href="/" class="text-primary hover:underline">Home</a> · <a href="/random-chat" class="text-primary hover:underline">Random Chat</a> · <a href="/voice-chat" class="text-primary hover:underline">Voice Chat</a></p></footer>
</Layout>
